# Phase 10 - Leitner Engine & Special Rules

This phase implements the complete spaced repetition logic, progression intervals, and safety/reset rules of the Leitner system. Since this is an offline-first application, the learning logic is executed on the mobile device (SQLite) and synchronized to the server when online.

---

## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> **Progression Timings:**
> - Box 1: Immediate/Always available.
> - Box 2: Due 3 days after entering Box 2.
> - Box 3: Due 7 days after entering Box 3.
> - Box 4: Due 16 days after entering Box 4.
> - Box 5: Due 31 days after entering Box 5.
> - Finished Cards: Mastered pool (moves here from Box 5 upon correct answer).
>
> **Due-Date Overdue Reset (Rule A):**
> A card due on a given day that is NOT reviewed by the end of that day (local time) will be reset to Box 1.

