### Component 1: Domain Events & Sync (Backend)

We will define the backend event models and implement the synchronization endpoint `/api/v1/statistics/sync` to resolve client sync progress, update states, and dispatch the corresponding domain events on the server's `IEventBus`.

#### [NEW] [CardReviewedEvent.cs](file:///E:/projects/leitner-learning-platform/backend/LeitnerPlatform.Core/Events/CardReviewedEvent.cs)
Define the server-side event emitted when a card is reviewed.
- Fields: `UserId`, `CourseId`, `CardNumber`, `Box`, `ReviewedAt`

#### [NEW] [CardFinishedEvent.cs](file:///E:/projects/leitner-learning-platform/backend/LeitnerPlatform.Core/Events/CardFinishedEvent.cs)
Define the event emitted when a card moves to the Finished Cards pool.
- Fields: `UserId`, `CourseId`, `CardNumber`, `FinishedAt`

#### [NEW] [DueDateOverdueResetEvent.cs](file:///E:/projects/leitner-learning-platform/backend/LeitnerPlatform.Core/Events/DueDateOverdueResetEvent.cs)
